<v Ira Glass>[赞助名单]

00:58:24.960 --> 00:58:29.690
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, or as he likes to be known--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ的管理由托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）监督，或者他喜欢被称为——

00:58:29.690 --> 00:58:35.160
